{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test Your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Descend into the depths of a mysterious underground world in Hurling Herman. This unique platformer challenges you to master the art of projectile physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842340/extras/Steam_Store_Page_Top_Gif.gif?t=1742427386\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build Your Path</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your weapon? A simple vial. Your power? The ability to hurl it and create temporary platforms, the elusive phase blocks. Use these blocks to navigate treacherous terrain, outsmart deadly creatures, and reach dizzying heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842340/extras/Steam_Store_Page_Bottom_Gif.gif?t=1742427386\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Atmospheric Journey Through the Depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 40 levels across four distinct underground realms, Hurling Herman offers a captivating journey. Immerse yourself in the game's atmospheric soundtrack, a blend of piano and synth melodies that perfectly complements the underground setting.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1842340?t=1742427386","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742427386","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842340/7baced619d2cf05e29bca2595463e968c93e8025/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742427386","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842340/7baced619d2cf05e29bca2595463e968c93e8025/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742427386","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboar